  "custody": "Self-custodied. Claude (Opus 5.5, in Tim Hulshof's project) designed the method, prepares the inputs and will run the evaluation; no external custodian. Separation rests on recorded order: this method freeze (git commit + Claude project record), then panel A inputs (media, carbon sources, base models, adjudication packets and decisions) and an inputs freeze, then the first download of panel A fitness tables.",
  "uninspected_evidence": "No fitness table (fit_logratios, fit_t) of any panel A or panel B organism has been downloaded; the panel metadata manifest lists every file downloaded for them (experiment and gene metadata, protein sequences). Panel A condition names have not been read; only scripts printing counts, medium names and the aerobic flag have touched the experiment tables. Training exposure of the model to published phenotypes of these organisms is unknown.",
